  "name": null,
  "problem": "The functions $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ are differentiable on an open interval containing $x=7.$ The values of $f,$ $g,$ and their respective derivatives are shown in the following table:\n\n| $x$ | $f(x)$ | ${f}^{′}(x)$ | $g(x)$ | ${g}^{′}(x)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $7$ | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ | $2$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nFind ${lim}_{x\\to 7}\\frac{f(x)}{{x}^{2}g(x)}.$",
